2	line	Player	King Roald sent me to check on Drezel.
2	line	Mysterious Voice	Drezel? Right... I, er... Just give me a moment.
2	box	You hear someone moving around followed by what sounds like panicked muttering.
2	line	Mysterious Voice	Okay, he's just coming! Wait a second!
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	Hello, my name is Drevil.
2	line	Mysterious Voice	Drezel!
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	I mean Drezel. How can I help?
2	line	Player	Er... Is everything okay in there?
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	Yes, totally fine. Now, what can I do for you?
2	line	Player	Well, the King hadn't heard from you for a few days. He sent me to make sure everything's okay.
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	I see... And, uh, what would you do if everything wasn't okay?
2	line	Player	I'm not sure. Ask you what help you need I suppose.
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	Ah, good, well, I don't think...
2	line	Mysterious Voice	Hey... The dog!
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	Ah, actually there is something I could use some help with. Will you do me a favour, adventurer?
2	line	Player	What kind of favour?
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	Well, there's this horrible big... dog-like thing that's moved into the mausoleum outside. It's causing all kinds of problems. Could you get rid of it for me?
2	line	Player	I don't know... Something about all this seems a bit suspicious... I think I'd better go and check in with the King.
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	No, no, there's no need for that. He's a very busy man! Besides, you said yourself that he sent you here to help me, right?
2	line	Player	Right...
2	line	Mysterious Voice 2	Then please, deal with that dog for me.
2	line	Player	Hmm...
2	action	end
