0	section	Talking to King Roald about the now dead dog
1	line	Player	Greetings, your majesty.
1	line	King Roald	Yes, citizen. Do you need something?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	About that job I'm doing...
2	line	Player	About that job I'm doing...
2	line	King Roald	You have news of Drezel for me?
2	line	Player	Well, I went to the temple and spoke to... Drezel. He asked me to kill a dog in the mausoleum.
2	line	King Roald	A dog? Tell me you didn't do it?!
2	line	Player	Well...
2	line	King Roald	Are you a complete imbecile?
2	line	Player	I tried to tell you it was a bit suspicious, but you told me to help Drezel!
2	line	King Roald	Do you even realise what you've done? That mausoleum contains the only passage between Morytania and Misthalin! Not only that, it's built right over the source of the River Salve!
2	line	King Roald	That 'dog' was responsible for guarding the entrance to the mausoleum! With it gone, there's nothing to stop someone from sabotaging the blessings on the river. Thanks to you, all of Misthalin is now at risk!
2	line	Player	But Drezel...
2	line	King Roald	Do you not see what's happened here, you absolute cretin! Obviously some fiend has done something to Drezel and tricked your feeble intellect into helping them!
2	line	King Roald	Now you get back there and get this mess sorted out. If you don't do whatever is necessary to safeguard this kingdom from attack, I will see you beheaded for high treason!
2	line	Player	Y-yes, your highness.
2	action	end
