1	line	King Roald	Yes, citizen. Do you need something?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	About that job I'm doing...
2	line	Player	About that job I'm doing...
2	line	King Roald	Why haven't you ensured the border with Morytania is secure yet?
2	line	Player	Okay, okay... I'm going, I'm going... There's no need to shout...
2	line	King Roald	No need to shout?! Listen, and listen well, and see if your puny mind can comprehend this: if the border is not protected, then we are all at the mercy of the vampyres!
2	line	King Roald	I would say that me shouting at you for your incompetence is the least of your worries right now. Now get yourself back to Paterdomus! At once!
